#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:5
msgid "Show linked item"
msgstr "显示链接项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:7
msgid ""
"On of the advantages of working with `cross references`_ on E-CAE tools like"
" QElectroTech is the possibility to find the linked `elements`_ "
"automatically. QElectroTech allows finding a linked `element`_ easily."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 等 E-CAE 工具中使用 `交叉引用 <cross references_>`_ 的优点之一是能够自动找到链接的 `元件"
" <elements_>`_ 。QElectroTech 可以轻松找到链接的 `元件 <element_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:11
msgid ""
"If the `master`_ and `slave/s`_ element/s are at the same `folio`_, only by "
"placing the mouse at one `element`_, the other/s will be remarked in blue. "
"The linked `element/s`_ can also be found from the `element properties`_."
msgstr ""
"如果 `主元件 <master_>`_ 与 `slave/s`_ 元件位于同一 `图幅 <folio_>`_ ，只需将鼠标放在一个 `元件 "
"<element_>`_ 上，其他元件就会以蓝色标示。链接的 `element/s`_ 也可以从 `元件属性 <element "
"properties_>`_ 中找到。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech elements cross reference"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件交叉引用"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:20
msgid ""
"At the case that the `elements`_ are at different `folios`_, the linked "
"`element/s`_ can only be found from the `element properties`_."
msgstr ""
"如果 `元件 <elements_>`_ 位于不同的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中，则只能从 `元件属性 <element "
"properties_>`_ 中找到链接的 `element/s`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:24
msgid "Show slave linked item"
msgstr "显示从元件链接项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:26
msgid ""
"Select the `slave element`_ which should be linked from the `project "
"collection`_ or from the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `项目集合 <project collection_>`_ 或 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中选择要链接的 `从元件 <slave "
"element_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:27
msgid ""
"Right click on the `element`_ selected and choose the option **Edit the "
"element**."
msgstr "右键单击选中的 `元件 <element_>`_ ，选择 **编辑元件** 选项。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:32
#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:59
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:34
#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:61
msgid ""
"`Display`_ the **Cross-reference (Slave)** tab from the element editor PopUP"
" window"
msgstr "在元件编辑器弹出窗口中 `显示 <Display_>`_ **交叉引用（从元件）** 标签页"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:39
#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:47
#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:66
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech cross reference tab element properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 交叉引用标签页中的元件属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:41
msgid ""
"Search and select the desired `slave element`_ from the **Element related** "
"table."
msgstr "在 **相关元件** 表中搜索并选择所需的 `从元件 <slave element_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:42
msgid ""
"Right click on the `slave element`_ and select the option **Show item** to "
"find and display the `master element`_."
msgstr ""
"右键单击 `从元件 <slave element_>`_ ，选择 **显示项** 选项以查找并显示 `主元件 <master element_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:51
msgid "Show Master linked item"
msgstr "显示主元件链接项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:53
msgid ""
"Select the `slave element`_ from the `project collection`_ or from the "
"`workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `项目集合 <project collection_>`_ 或 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中选择 `从元件 <slave "
"element_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:54
msgid ""
"Right click on the selected element and choose the option **Edit the "
"element**."
msgstr "右键单击选中的元件，选择 **编辑元件** 选项。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/related_items.rst:68
msgid ""
"Press **See the linked item** to find and display the `master element`_."
msgstr "按 **查看链接项** 查找并显示 `主元件 <master element_>`_ 。"
